<title>INDIA: RBI data on Indian forex turnover Jan-Mar 1997.</title>
<headline>RBI data on Indian forex turnover Jan-Mar 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India on Tuesday released the following data on turnover in the Indian forex market in the first quarter of 1997:</p>
<p>						     (All figures in million$)</p>
<p>					  PURCHASES</p>
<p>					  ----------</p>
<p>			     Merchant</p>
<p>			  FCY/INR				 FCY/FCY</p>
<p>	   Spot   Forward   Forward	Spot Forward  Forward</p>
<p>				 cancellation		  cancellation</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Jan-97  4,225    1,217	  297	288   467	282</p>
<p>Feb-97  4,030    1,256	  190	207   554	313</p>
<p>Mar-97  5,145    1,879	  227	386   583	315</p>
<p>			  Interbank</p>
<p>			  FCY/INR				 FCY/FCY</p>
<p>	   Spot   Swap   Forward	Spot   Swap  Forward</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Jan-97   6,674  12,277  1,719	11,075  3,180     643</p>
<p>Feb-97   6,627  11,764  1,734	11,821  3,142     584</p>
<p>Mar-97   8,027  13,599  1,960	10,601  3,117     452</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				    SALES</p>
<p>			     Merchant</p>
<p>			  FCY/INR				 FCY/FCY</p>
<p>	   Spot   Forward   Forward	Spot Forward  Forward</p>
<p>				 cancellation		  cancellation</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
