<p>Feb-97  3,805    1,315	  312	174   578	308</p>
<p>Mar-97  4,250	855	  265	429   583	310</p>
<p>			  Interbank</p>
<p>			  FCY/INR				 FCY/FCY</p>
<p>	   Spot   Swap   Forward	Spot   Swap  Forward</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Jan-97   6,702  12,073  1,706	11,544  3,077     636</p>
<p>Feb-97   7,159  11,536  1,837	11,903  3,305     558</p>
